    <rnb>2</rnb>
    <tib>chos thams cad rdzogs pa chen po byang chub kyi sems su 'dus pa'i mdo</tib>
    <skt>sarba d+harmA a ti mahA/ bo d+hi tsi ta su tra</skt>
    <coloph>de nas 'dus pa'i tshogs chen de dag thaMd// ston pa kun tu bzang po'i spyan sngar// rab tu shin tu mdun pa'i sgo nas 'khod de// thaMd mgrin gcig pa'i sgo nas zhus pa// ston pa kun tu bzang pos ni// chos rnams kun tu snang bar mdzad// ston pa rdo rje sems dpa' des// don de rtsa ba gcig tu bstan// rtsa ba gcig gi don bstan pa// chos rnams kun gyi rtsa ba rtogs// zhes zhuso// de nas sems dpa' rdo rje des// chos thams cad rtsa ba gcig pa'i mdo dang// 'grel pa 'digsungso// chos kun rtsa ba gcig pa 'di lta ste// chos nyid sems nyid gcig tu bstan pa la// grangs dang rnam pa yongs kyis bgrang du med// ma bcos rtogs pa'i rnal 'byor pas// ti bya namkha'i lam la mkhas pa bzhin// mi rtog namkha' lta bur gnas par bya// rgyu rkyen ma byung rkyen med ma skyes pa'i// thams cad 'byung ba'i snying po byang chub la// yod pa'i sgros dang med pa'i skur pa dang// yin min sgro skur btags pa ga la yod// ces gsungso// ces byang chub kyi sems kyi mdo dang 'grel pa rdzogso</coloph>
